 57	The score is deterministic and calculated after Gemini observations are mapped
 58	to the rule registry. Gemini does not choose the number. For every dimension,
 59	the interface shows `Why this score` and a single `Action` based on its
 60	highest-priority finding. A 5 still receives a preservation action so the
 61	marketer knows what should not change.
